g", "id": "2152338755337174", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499619836_2152338758670507_1975808050701198849_n.png?_nc_cat=109&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=keyqMWn2_f4Q7kNvwFs8U00&_nc_oc=AdomqO75mNQffoskYcsTYEbw91x0j6FQINBtYd0A4f1LEmUZmDWRUd8-EVhqEJgXvH8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQSv-w4KnFQYvFcSxMFtC9t-kPEUjh2jHDce4K-Jk2IBOQ&oe=6AFDCF03"}, {"file_name": "\u4e94\u56fe-3.png", "id": "1220393037814760", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499619808_1220393041148093_2014269959186670310_n.png?_nc_cat=106&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=7jFj0UwTjyMQ7kNvwE9UKJW&_nc_oc=AdoVTu9Ov-38OSKngLgdOCg06YKREx3xEpQ8MX9nT5ppeGDsK_GBHTYYqh8xqHnV2oc&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQQ1i8EKjr-P8W2jbYijFBB-hbqXd0NOwUOO080iGjooEA&oe=6AFDBC05"}, {"file_name": "\u4e94\u56fe-4.png", "id": "1340198591394944", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499620856_1340198594728277_2293004820206353383_n.png?_nc_cat=100&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=42Cq2YT4kEMQ7kNvwHQi5y9&_nc_oc=Adq3o5jSfqWmDJmmhxdwi385SktEtPpwaZhJaQ-CMsWSKhg1BQNtoIvHtpFQ2ODmu7g&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQS-a1yESz3IyZyfocgcz9IrsosXpBuSDCrX14XCM55KBQ&oe=6AFDE031"}, {"file_name": "\u4e94\u56fe-5.png", "id": "1641607013808215", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499620875_1641607017141548_3029424313347048196_n.png?_nc_cat=108&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=o93Ja0lpXTgQ7kNvwGPIfIJ&_nc_oc=AdpLr6MgG8WIFZpnnx-GFDQc10W3p9qRYiF2kjJRX8nMGsF2drxN7dztlhBCmwtNQXk&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQTEGwo-6ICaPjW9CdaWZNptYXDYHrlzEjYBoRCnmXFECA&oe=6AFDDB79"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "2560 1440.png", "id": "1478392696833414", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499619677_1478392700166747_8691469167511298160_n.png?_nc_cat=103&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=vnxMwcusZoAQ7kNvwFFTiq0&_nc_oc=AdqaGK4X_ZgkjlKfD0dxVW-e3S2wnjTQP8Kdx2DbBff33QfCYSbMzEtRRi6r3CaWG5Q&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQQpYaGgak01jxnltGXIuWuy24rhh_L_Zd97WSABV7Gq7g&oe=6AFDB886"}, "display_name": "ZG: Zombie Garden Defense Demo", "keywords": ["zombie", "shooter", "plants", "survival", "fps"], "long_description": "PLANT. SHOOT. SURVIVE.\n\nZG is a VR plant defense game against zombie waves. But this time\u2026 you fight too.\n\n\ud83c\udf31 Strategic Plant Defense\n\nGrow powerful plants and combine different abilities to stop massive zombie waves. \n{1897489697616756}\n\n\ud83e\udeb4 Rip Plants to Fight\n\nThings getting out of control? Grab plants straight from the ground and use them in combat. Your defense becomes your weapon. \n{27152109014399031}\n\ud83d\udd2b You Are the Defense\n\nYou don't just build it, you stand in it. Blast through huge zombie hordes in intense first-person battles. \n{1670386994104974}\n\n\ud83e\udddf Boss: Toilet Zombie\n\nA massive Toilet Zombie with earth-shaking attacks and chaotic patterns. Your plants won't be enough, every bullet matters. \n{1698736204367815}\n\nFree demo with 7 playable levels! Try the full version to unlock more plants, stronger weapons, and harder challenges.\n\nThe invasion never stops growing.\n\nYour garden is under siege.\n\nSurvive it.\n", "short_description": "ZG is a VR plant defense game against zombie waves.\nBut this time\u2026 you fight too."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://digi-eden.com/page/PrivacyPolicy.html", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "DigiEden Studio", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://www.digi-eden.com/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534